WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.670
&gt;&gt;&gt; IT'S BEEN
MORE THAN TWO WEEKS SINCE FOUR

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.139
IDAHO COLLEGE STUDENTS WERE
MURDERED.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.676
POLICE IN THE COLLEGE TOWN OF
MOSCOW, IDAHO HAVE SAID ALL

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.580
ALONG THEY BELIEVE THIS WAS A
TARGETED ATTACK.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.582
NOW THEY'RE CLARIFYING THAT
STATEMENT, CREATING A LITTLE BIT

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:19.619
OF CONFUSION -- A LOT OF
CONFUSION, ACTUALLY, AS STUDENTS

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:25.325
AND RESIDENTS HELD A CANDLE LITE
MEMORIAL SERVICE LAST NIGHT.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:29.062
AS POLICE WERE TALKING AS THIS
WAS GOING ON ABOUT A

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:33.199
MISCOMMUNICATION THEY HAD WITH
THE COUNTY PROSECUTOR'S OFFICE.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.436
VERONICA MIRACLE IS LIVE NEAR
MOSCOW.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.938
THIS HAS BEEN THE QUESTION
PLAGUING THIS.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.742
WHICH IS WHAT POLICE ARE SAYING,
WHAT THEY AREN'T SAYING AND WHAT

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.111
WE STILL DO NOT KNOW ABOUT WHAT
HAPPENED HERE.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.813
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THAT'S RIGHT,
KAITLAN.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:51.250
A LOT OF THIS CONFUSION IN THE
LAST 12 HOURS SEEMS TO BE AROUND

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.188
THE NOTION THAT TWO OR ONE OF
THE SPECIFIC ROOMMATES WERE

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.390
SPECIFICALLY TARGETED.
I'M GOING TO READ PART OF THEIR

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.692
STATEMENT THEY RELEASED LAST
NIGHT.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:05.965
DETECTIVES DO NOT CURRENTLY KNOW
IF THE RESIDENTS OR OCCUPANTS

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.967
WERE SPECIFICALLY TARGETED BUT
CONTINUE TO INVESTIGATE.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.070
POLICE HAVEN'T ANSWERED OUR
QUESTIONS ABOUT THIS CONFUSION,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.339
THE GOING BACK AND FORTH.
I THINK HERE IN THE COMMUNITY

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:19.212
ALL THAT MATTERS IS THAT A
SUSPECT STILL HASN'T BEEN

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.048
ARRESTED.
THE UNSOLVED FATAL STABBING

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:26.319
DEATHS OF FOUR UNIVERSITY OF
IDAHO STUDENTS LEAVES THE MOSCOW

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.821
COMMUNITY WITH GRAVE UNCERTAINTY
AND LITTLE INFORMATION MORE THAN

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:32.559
TWO WEEKS AFTER THE ATTACK.
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE JUST GOING TO HAVE TO

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:38.031
LOVE EACH OTHER, HUG EACH OTHER.
&gt;&gt; THE UNIVERSITY HELD A VIGIL

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:40.066
WEDNESDAY WHERE THE FAMILIES
SPOKE ABOUT THEIR LOSS.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:45.104
&gt;&gt; SHE WAS SUCH A HAPPY -- JUST
SUCH A GREAT KID, A PERFECT

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:48.308
LITTLE BABY.
AND SO JUST SMART AND FUNNY AND

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.276
BEAUTIFUL.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE MOST IMPORTANT

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:55.515
MESSAGE THAT WE HAVE FOR YOU AND
YOUR FAMILIES, IS TO MAKE SURE

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.251
YOU SPEND AS MUCH TIME AS
POSSIBLE WITH THOSE PEOPLE

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.019
BECAUSE TIME IS PRECIOUS AND
IT'S SOMETHING YOU CAN'T GET

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:05.358
BACK.
&gt;&gt; VICTIMS KIRSTEN GILLIBRAND

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:11.698
AND MADISON WERE CHILDHOOD
FRIENDS.

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:17.737
&gt;&gt; SIXTH GRADE THEY FOUND EACH
OTHER, AND EVERY DAY THEY DID

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:19.806
HOMEWORK TOGETHER, CAME TO OUR
HOUSE TOGETHER, THEY SHARED

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.041
EVERYTHING.
AND IN THE END THEY DIED

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.876
TOGETHER.
IN THE SAME ROOM AND THE SAME

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:28.648
BED.
IT'S A SHAME, IT AND HURTS WITH

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:34.187
THE BEAUTY OF THE TWO ALWAYS
BEING TOGETHER SOMETHING THAT

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:39.559
WILL -- IT COMFORTS US, IT LOET
US KNOW THEY WERE WITH THEIR

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:43.730
BEST FRIENDS.
&gt;&gt; A SPOKESPERSON FOR THE MOSCOW

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.966
POLICE DEPARTMENT SAID THEY WERE
STARTING TO RECEIVE TEST RESULTS

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:52.839
RELATED TO THE INVESTIGATION.
IT COMES AS POLICE ARE

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:57.477
CLARIFYING STATEMENTS THAT SAID
THE MURDERS WERE TARGETED AND

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.178
I
ISOLATED.

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:04.751
THE LATEST STATEMENTS SAY THEY
DO NOT KNOW IF THE VICTIMS WERE

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:08.888
TARGETED AS SEVERAL COMMENTS
HAVE CITED THIS INCIDENT AS A

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:14.193
TARGETED ATTACK.
INVESTORS RETRACED THE VICTIMS'

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:17.030
WHEREABOUTS ON THE NIGHT OF THE
MURDER BUT STILL HAVE NOT NAMED

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.133
A SUSPECT.
ON TUESDAY AUTHORITIES REMOVED

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:24.504
CARS FROM THE CRIME SCENE.
THE IDAHO STATE POLICE HAS

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:26.839
PROVIDED SECURITY FOR THE CAMPUS
AND THE COMMUNITY GIVEN THE

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.108
MOUNTING FEARS A MURDERER IS
STILL AT LARGE.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:33.879
&gt;&gt; I THOUGHT IT WOULD MAKE ME
FEEL SAFER BUT IT DOESN'T

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:37.450
BECAUSE IT REMINDS ME THERE'S
STILL SOMEONE OUT THERE.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.819
&gt;&gt; Reporter: CERTAINLY HERE IN
THE COMMUNITY EVERYWHERE YOU GO

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:42.822
THERE IS AN INCREASED SECURITY
PRESENCE.

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:45.692
IDAHO STATE POLICE EVERYWHERE
TRYING TO MAKE THE COMMUNITY

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:47.026
FEEL SAFE.
KAITLAN.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.996
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN SEE WHY THEY DON'T.
THANK YOU FOR THAT REPORT.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:53.299
&gt;&gt;&gt; I WANT TO BRING IN CHIEF LAW
ENFORCEMENT AND INTELLIGENCE

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.601
ANALYST MR. JOHN MILLER.
GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.970
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, DON.
&gt;&gt; THIS STORY IS FASCINATING IN

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:02.275
THE SENSE IT'S A SMALL TOWN,
RIGHT, AND THEY DON'T HAVE

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:05.178
ANYONE YET -- INITIALLY THEY
SAID THEY DIDN'T THINK IT WAS A

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:07.680
THREAT TO THE PUBLIC AND NOW
THEY'RE SAYING IT POSSIBLY IS A

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.482
THREAT TO THE PUBLIC.
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THIS?

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:15.555
&gt;&gt; I THINK THEY'RE GETTING TIED
UP IN SEMANTICS WHICH IS A

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:18.658
SYMPTOM OF NOT HAVING A BREAK IN
THE CASE THEY CAN TALK ABOUT

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:22.061
THAT'S NEWSWORTHY.
SO PEOPLE ARE GOING BACK, TRYING

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.096
TO INTERPRET STATEMENTS WORD BY
WORD.

00:04:24.096 --> 00:04:28.568
I THINK WHAT YOU HAVE HERE IS
YOU'RE GOING INTO THE THIRD WEEK

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:32.204
OF THE CASE THAT MEANS THERE'S
BEEN ENOUGH TIME FOR DNA RESULTS

00:04:32.204 --> 00:04:35.475
AND OTHER THINGS TO COME BACK.
WHAT THEY'RE LOOKING FOR THERE

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:37.610
IS WHO ARE THE KNOWN
CONTRIBUTORS, THE VICTIMS AND

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.880
PEOPLE WHO LIVED IN THE HOUSE,
WHERE IS THAT UNKNOWN

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:46.719
CONTRIBUTOR?
THEY TAKE THE UNKNOWN DNA, PUT

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:51.224
IT IN THE KSYSTEM WITH THE FBI.
THAT GIVES THEM TWO THINGS, ONE

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:55.495
EVERYONE ARRESTED WITH A
FELONY'S DNA.

00:04:55.495 --> 00:05:00.266
SO THAT'S A GOOD START.
BUT SECOND IT GIVES THE DNA IN

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:03.636
THE SYSTEM RECOVERED AT OTHER
CRIME SCENES THAT ISN'T

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.037
IDENTIFIED.
IT DOESN'T LEAD THEM TO A

00:05:05.037 --> 00:05:08.107
PERSON, IT CAN LEAD TO ANOTHER
CRIME SCENE.

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:11.544
SO ALL THOSE WHEELS ARE TURNING
NOW, AND THOSE CLUES ARE GOING

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:14.247
TO BE COMING IN AND RUN DOWN.
&gt;&gt; THEY HAVEN'T SAID ANYTHING

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:18.351
ABOUT A SUSPECT, DOES THAT MEAN
THEY DON'T KNOW ANYTHING OR

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:22.188
THEY'RE NOT READY TO SAY IT YET.
&gt;&gt; YESTERDAY THEY SAID WE HAVE

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:24.524
NOT NAMED A SUSPECT.
THAT DOESN'T MEAN THERE HASN'T

00:05:24.524 --> 00:05:26.826
BEEN A SUSPECT.
THEY'VE BEEN THROUGH A HANDFUL

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:32.098
OF SUSPECTS THAT HAVE RISEN AND
FALLEN AS ALIBIS HAVE CHECKED

00:05:32.098 --> 00:05:33.800
OUT, AND THEY'LL GO THROUGH
MORE.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:38.304
&gt;&gt; ARE THE KIDS SAFE?
&gt;&gt; SO --

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:42.608
&gt;&gt; ALL THOSE COLLEGE STUDENTS.
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT YES, BUT NO.

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:46.579
THERE'S AN INCREASED POLICE
PRESENCE, THE STATE POLICE IS

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:50.082
PATROLLING THE CAMPUS AND TOWN,
ALONG WITH LOCAL AUTHORITIES.

00:05:50.082 --> 00:05:56.289
BUT UNTIL WE KNOW THE WHO AND
THE WHAT AND THE WHY, IT'S HARD

00:05:56.289 --> 00:06:00.193
TO SAY THIS TARGETED DISCUSSION.
TARGETED OR NOT TARGETED, HAS

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:04.864
SOME MEANING.
WHOEVER WENT TO THAT HOUSE CAME

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:08.734
THERE DELIBERATELY.
IT APPEARS WITH THE INTENT TO

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:12.138
KILL EVERYONE INSIDE.
ARMED WITH A PARTICULAR WEAPON

00:06:12.138 --> 00:06:14.340
THEY BROUGHT FOR THAT PARTICULAR
PURPOSE.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:18.811
WERE THEY TARGETING THE HOUSE,
AN INDIVIDUAL INSIDE, OR WAS IT

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:21.547
ALWAYS JUST GOING TO BE
EVERYBODY?

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:26.786
THAT'S WHAT THEY'RE STRUGGLING
IN THE WHY DEPARTMENT.

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:30.223
SO THE MORE RANDOM THIS IS.
IF IT'S A DRIFTER THAT SAID I'M

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:33.326
GOING IN THAT HOUSE TO KILL
EVERYBODY, THE LESS THEY'RE

00:06:33.326 --> 00:06:35.194
SAFE.
IF IT'S SOMETHING TO DO WITH ONE

00:06:35.194 --> 00:06:37.630
OR MORE OF THOSE PEOPLE IT'S
CONTAINED.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:41.234
BUT UNTIL THEY KNOW OR TELL US
THAT ANSWER, IT'S HARD TO TELL

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:44.337
EVERYBODY, EVERYTHING IS SAFE.
&gt;&gt; AND WE'RE LEFT TO WONDER.

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:46.405
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU VERY MUCH, JOHN 

00:06:46.505 --> 00:06:47.707
MILLER, APPRECIATE IT. 

